BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:kimolos-chorio-dormition-panigiri-chorio-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270814
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270816
SUMMARY:Dormition panigiri\, Chorio
LOCATION:Chorio\, Kimolos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:Kimolos keeps Dekapentavgoustos simply: vespers on the 14th\, liturgy and a procession of the icon through the lanes of Chorio on the 15th\, and a traditional glenti with violin and laouto in the village. It coincides with the peak of the summer 'Cultural August' events run by the Athens-based Kimolian associations\, so the island is at its fullest — the Milos–Kimolos ferry from Pollonia gets very busy those days.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kimolos/#chorio-dormition-panigiri-chorio
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/kimolos/#chorio-dormition-panigiri-chorio
END:VEVENT
